&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, Product-Led Growth (PLG)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaviyo&#39;s Growth, Billing &amp;amp; Monetization team is responsible for making it easier for businesses to discover, adopt, and grow with Klaviyo. We build the product experiences that connect customer value to sustainable business growth, spanning onboarding, activation, self-service purchasing, subscriptions, billing, and monetization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Klaviyo continues to expand its platform and introduce new products and AI-powered capabilities, our team plays a critical role in helping customers realize value quickly, understand the full breadth of what Klaviyo offers, and seamlessly grow their investment over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best growth strategies are built into the product itself. By combining customer empathy, thoughtful design, experimentation, and data-driven decision-making, we create intuitive experiences that drive adoption, conversion, retention, and long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Manager to help define and accelerate Klaviyo&#39;s product-led growth strategy, with a focus on creating seamless, high-converting customer experiences across the entire product lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of product experience, growth, and monetization. You&#39;ll own key initiatives that help customers move from initial signup to activation, discover and adopt additional capabilities, and expand their relationship with Klaviyo through intuitive self-service experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just about optimizing conversion funnels or running experiments. We&#39;re looking for someone who understands that sustainable growth comes from delivering meaningful customer value, removing friction, and building experiences that make it easy for customers to get started, see results, and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with engineering, design, analytics, marketing, finance, and go-to-market teams to identify growth opportunities, shape product strategy, and deliver measurable business impact. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to influence how Klaviyo scales its self-service business while supporting an increasingly sophisticated product portfolio and customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Make a Difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own key product-led growth initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; across the customer lifecycle, including signup, onboarding, activation, conversion, retention, and expansion, with a focus on improving customer experience and driving measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize the self-service customer journey&lt;/strong&gt; by identifying and removing friction across product discovery, account setup, trial experiences, purchasing, and upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate time to value&lt;/strong&gt; by building intuitive onboarding and activation experiences that help customers quickly understand Klaviyo&#39;s capabilities and achieve meaningful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive conversion and monetization&lt;/strong&gt; through thoughtful in-product experiences that help customers understand available plans, evaluate additional capabilities, and seamlessly upgrade or expand their usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner on pricing, packaging, and billing experiences&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure customers can easily understand, purchase, and manage their subscriptions as their businesses grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a culture of experimentation&lt;/strong&gt; by developing hypotheses, designing and evaluating experiments, and translating insights into product improvements that drive sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and measure success&lt;/strong&gt; through clear growth metrics, including activation, trial-to-paid conversion, feature adoption, retention, expansion, and revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage customer insights and behavioral data&lt;/strong&gt; to identify opportunities, understand points of friction, and prioritize initiatives with the greatest potential customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across product and go-to-market teams&lt;/strong&gt; to connect self-service and sales-assisted growth motions, creating consistent experiences for customers across different segments and stages of maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and execute a product roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; that balances near-term growth opportunities with longer-term investments in scalable, customer-centric product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3–5+ years of product management experience, ideally with a track record of driving product-led growth, activation, conversion, or monetization within a B2B SaaS or subscription-based business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong product and UX instincts, with a demonstrated ability to simplify complex customer journeys and build intuitive, high-quality experiences that drive adoption and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the fundamentals of product-led growth and have experience improving meaningful business metrics through product improvements rather than relying solely on marketing or acquisition strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly analytical and comfortable defining success metrics, interpreting behavioral data, identifying opportunities, and using experimentation to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong customer-first mindset and regularly leverage research, feedback, and product usage insights to understand customer needs and inform your roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how product experience and monetization intersect, including the tradeoffs between reducing friction, delivering customer value, and driving revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked closely with engineering and design teams to ship impactful products, balancing speed, quality, and long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable operating in ambiguity, can identify opportunities without a predefined playbook, and bring a strong bias for action and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can influence cross-functional stakeholders, communicate a clear product vision, and align teams around measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think like a builder, with the curiosity, creativity, and ownership mindset to challenge assumptions, experiment with new approaches, and continuously improve the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning PLG initiatives at a high-growth B2B SaaS company with both self-service and sales-assisted customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with subscription monetization, pricing and packaging, billing, checkout, or self-service upgrade experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with growth experimentation, funnel analytics, cohort analysis, and tools used to understand customer behavior and product performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building onboarding, activation, or expansion experiences for complex, multi-product SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in martech, ecommerce, CRM, or other data-driven SaaS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered tools and emerging technologies to accelerate product development, experimentation, or customer value delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product-led growth is central to how Klaviyo scales its business and delivers value to customers. As our platform becomes more powerful and our product portfolio expands, the opportunity to simplify how customers discover, adopt, and grow with Klaviyo has never been greater.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll directly influence some of the most important moments in the customer journey, from the first experience with Klaviyo to the decision to invest more deeply in the platform. Your work will help shape how we acquire, activate, convert, and retain customers while building a more seamless, scalable, and customer-centric growth engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to own highly visible initiatives, work across multiple product areas, and make a measurable impact on both customer success and Klaviyo&#39;s long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$136,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$204,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
